text = "1. Magic attacks cost 5 Light.
    Keep your light above 20 to see 
    clearly—if it hits 0, the dark 
    consumes you (Game Over).
2. Defeat monsters(25 hp) They deal 
    10 damage per attack.
3. In Level 2 Astra has to destroy 7 skulls
    in order for the portal to appear
4. Attack defeat enemis and BE THE HOPE
    FOR YOUR WORLD.

MENU CONTROLS:
WASD/ arrow keys - pointer control
Space/Enter - Select

GAME CONTROL:
go left - left arrow
go right - right arrow
Jump - Space
Attack - F
Exit Game - esc
"

